OL,3,GNEWSAMerchant seafarers' memorial to be
OL,4,Arefurbished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA monument to merchant seamen in Hull
OL,7,Fcity centre is to be refurbished.
OL,9,FThe 13ft (4m) high Hull Seafarers'
OL,10,FMemorial, which resembles the bow of a
OL,11,Fship, was installed in 2013 outside the
OL,12,FMaritime Museum.
OL,14,FHull City Council is to spend more than
OL,15,F#10,000 to repaint the metal structure
OL,16,Fin ship's colours and add anchors and a
OL,17,Fnew hand-carved Merchant Navy emblem.
OL,19,FThe site acts a memorial to all those
OL,20,Fwho sailed on the city's cargo and
OL,21,Ffishing fleets.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
